  "notes": "COMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {身|み}をよじる - to twist one's body (often from pain, tickling, or trying to escape)\n- {腹|はら}/お{腹|なか}をよじる - to twist one's belly (from laughing hard)\n- {腕|うで}をよじる - to twist someone's arm\n\nCONJUGATION NOTE:\nGodan verb conjugating with る. Dictionary form: よじる\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {捻|ひね}る - to twist, turn (more general)\n- {絞|しぼ}る - to wring, squeeze\n- よじ{登|のぼ}る - to climb (by twisting one's body)",
